# spec: placeholders kept verbatim in URL, query key and value, header value,
# spec: JSON body, multipart boundary, multipart field name and field value
### templated
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/{{version}}/users/{{userId}}?token={{token}}&{{extraParam}}=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Trace: {{traceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"{{userName}}","note":"{{ spaced }}"}
### templated-multipart
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary={{boundary}}

--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="{{fieldName}}"

{{fieldValue}}
--{{boundary}}--
